WEBVTT

01:36.070 --> 01:38.289
[Too Young To Love]

01:38.470 --> 01:41.250
[Episode 9]

01:46.490 --> 01:48.509
[Updates on your application
to the Malayan Conservatory of Music]

01:51.750 --> 01:55.440
Why did my scholarship application
get rejected again?

01:52.350 --> 01:55.620
[Updates on your application
to the Malayan Conservatory of Music]

02:27.670 --> 02:32.130
[I have wrestled with myself for long.
I'd rather just be me.]

02:36.910 --> 02:37.590
Xiaole!

02:38.190 --> 02:39.190
Tong Xiaole!

02:47.030 --> 02:47.829
What's wrong?

02:48.079 --> 02:49.079
Come downstairs.

02:49.120 --> 02:50.720
I want to show you something.

02:55.800 --> 02:56.400
What is it?

02:56.840 --> 02:57.800
Come here. Come here.

02:57.800 --> 02:59.400
I want to show you something.

02:59.470 --> 03:00.190
It's raining.

03:00.190 --> 03:01.470
Just come here. Hurry.

03:03.840 --> 03:04.590
What?

03:06.750 --> 03:07.430
Look.

03:09.280 --> 03:10.010
Do you see it?

03:11.280 --> 03:13.140
My calluses have been rubbed raw.

03:13.680 --> 03:14.870
What does this prove?

03:14.870 --> 03:16.800
It proves that on the path to success,

03:16.800 --> 03:18.660
I've taken another step forward.

03:19.079 --> 03:19.910
For this,

03:19.910 --> 03:21.710
you called me downstairs

03:22.000 --> 03:23.310
to stand here in the rain with you?

03:23.310 --> 03:24.710
I'm happy. What's wrong with that?

03:24.710 --> 03:25.280
Fine.

03:25.280 --> 03:26.960
It indeed is worth celebrating.

03:26.960 --> 03:28.190
Then I wish you success

03:28.190 --> 03:29.750
in passing the joint exam.

03:30.240 --> 03:30.680
Okay.

03:34.800 --> 03:35.850
Thanks to my hard work,

03:35.850 --> 03:40.380
[Hailan University School Exam Day
Go for it]

03:35.910 --> 03:37.870
I successfully passed the joint exam.

03:37.870 --> 03:38.630
Next,

03:38.630 --> 03:41.160
it'll be
the even more difficult school exam.

03:45.150 --> 03:45.800
Lan.

03:48.000 --> 03:49.000
During the exam,

03:49.360 --> 03:50.360
don't be nervous.

03:51.150 --> 03:52.410
Just perform as usual.

03:52.470 --> 03:52.910
Okay.

03:53.400 --> 03:54.030
Sister,

03:54.560 --> 03:56.150
you will definitely pass.

03:56.520 --> 03:57.120
Good luck.

03:57.360 --> 03:58.000
Okay.

03:58.520 --> 03:59.190
You really don't need me

03:59.190 --> 04:00.450
to take you to the exam?

04:01.000 --> 04:01.800
No need, Dad.

04:02.080 --> 04:03.740
Xiaole will come to pick me up.

04:09.030 --> 04:09.750
I'm off! I'm off!

04:09.750 --> 04:10.210
Bye bye!

04:12.430 --> 04:12.960
Let's go!

04:15.590 --> 04:16.790
Everything's ready?

04:18.000 --> 04:18.459
Not yet.

04:20.720 --> 04:21.310
I want to make a wish.

04:21.310 --> 04:22.310
Give me your hand.

04:23.360 --> 04:24.360
Make a wish.

04:25.950 --> 04:26.560
Bless me.

04:27.040 --> 04:29.040
Pass on the top student's luck to me.

04:29.240 --> 04:31.720
If you're going to make a wish,
do it properly.

04:31.720 --> 04:32.650
Close your eyes.

04:38.480 --> 04:39.040
Done.

04:40.070 --> 04:41.390
You already
have the top student's blessing.

04:41.390 --> 04:43.320
You definitely will pass the exam.

04:43.390 --> 04:43.830
Let's go.

04:43.830 --> 04:44.360
Let's go.

04:47.830 --> 04:48.480
Bundle up.

04:48.480 --> 04:49.610
It's cold on the way.

05:18.750 --> 05:19.510
Ning?

05:21.160 --> 05:23.360
How come you're taking the school exam?

05:24.390 --> 05:26.120
It was a last-minute decision.

05:33.750 --> 05:35.210
Something came up at home.

05:35.510 --> 05:39.070
My scholarship application
for the overseas university failed.

05:39.070 --> 05:40.930
The school exam is my only way out.

05:46.070 --> 05:47.390
Why are you wearing so little?

05:47.390 --> 05:48.320
Aren't you cold?

05:49.390 --> 05:50.000
Warm up.

05:55.510 --> 05:56.750
You don't think

05:57.720 --> 05:59.310
I was lying to you before, do you?

05:59.310 --> 06:00.190
Why would I?

06:01.000 --> 06:01.950
Since you didn't say anything,

06:01.950 --> 06:03.680
I'm sure you have your reasons.

06:03.830 --> 06:04.560
Don't worry.

06:04.630 --> 06:05.950
I'll keep your secret.

06:07.630 --> 06:08.390
Anyway,

06:08.750 --> 06:10.680
whether you're in China or abroad,

06:11.000 --> 06:12.730
you'll shine wherever you are.

06:12.870 --> 06:13.800
I believe in you.

06:16.040 --> 06:17.560
Actually, I...

06:17.830 --> 06:20.030
Whenever you're unhappy, just tell me.

06:20.160 --> 06:22.160
You don't have to tough it out alone.

06:26.160 --> 06:26.870
Thank you.

06:29.310 --> 06:30.310
Let's do our best.

06:30.630 --> 06:31.490
We've got this.

06:31.920 --> 06:32.780
I'm so nervous.

06:37.920 --> 06:39.270
During the one-month winter break,

06:39.270 --> 06:41.159
don't get too carried away!

06:41.270 --> 06:42.190
Take care!

06:42.190 --> 06:43.060
Bye bye.

06:43.080 --> 06:43.870
Alright, alright!

06:43.870 --> 06:44.640
Get going, everyone!

06:44.640 --> 06:45.310
Come. Come.

06:45.310 --> 06:46.310
Give me the stuff.

06:46.990 --> 06:47.640
Bye bye.

06:47.640 --> 06:48.230
Alright.

06:48.250 --> 06:48.990
Bye bye.

06:49.190 --> 06:50.430
Be careful when you leave later.

06:50.430 --> 06:52.030
-Turn off the lights.
-Okay.

06:52.750 --> 06:55.110
You two, how do you plan
to spend the winter break?

06:55.110 --> 06:55.920
I don't know.

06:56.190 --> 06:56.840
Lan,

06:56.920 --> 06:59.280
I heard Ning went to Hailan University
for the art exam.

06:59.280 --> 07:00.410
Did you run into her?

07:00.670 --> 07:01.400
Yes, I did.

07:03.670 --> 07:05.530
Wasn't she going to study abroad?

07:06.990 --> 07:08.550
I'm not too sure about that.

07:08.670 --> 07:10.430
Then we should just ask Ning.

07:10.920 --> 07:11.850
We'd better not.

07:12.010 --> 07:13.990
She'll tell us if she wants to.

07:14.160 --> 07:15.130
Let's not pry.

07:15.360 --> 07:16.480
Yi Lan is right.

07:16.480 --> 07:18.240
It indeed is not polite to ask directly.

07:18.240 --> 07:21.130
But Hailan University is pretty good too.

07:21.890 --> 07:23.300
I'll go ask Bu

07:23.480 --> 07:25.810
how to get admitted to Hailan University.

07:27.450 --> 07:27.890
Lan.

07:29.400 --> 07:30.130
Look at this.

07:30.240 --> 07:31.240
I recently discovered

07:30.300 --> 07:35.230
[L Photography]

07:31.240 --> 07:33.280
a super interesting social media account.

07:33.280 --> 07:35.340
Look, this photo looks just like you.

07:35.600 --> 07:36.450
Me?

07:38.040 --> 07:39.440
It does look a bit like me.

07:39.920 --> 07:41.280
Isn't this our school?

07:41.360 --> 07:41.800
Yeah.

07:43.090 --> 07:45.290
Beauties all have something in common.

07:46.360 --> 07:46.970
Ning.

07:51.600 --> 07:55.280
My mom brought this back from abroad.

07:55.530 --> 07:57.240
I heard you really like

07:57.360 --> 07:58.720
this brand of chocolate,

07:58.720 --> 07:59.800
so I...

08:11.600 --> 08:13.210
I have wrestled with myself for long.

08:13.210 --> 08:14.410
I'd rather just be me.

08:14.480 --> 08:16.130
I really like that quote too.

08:16.920 --> 08:18.580
I think you're truly amazing.

08:19.160 --> 08:20.040
No matter where you go,

08:20.040 --> 08:21.570
I think you'll always be...

08:21.970 --> 08:23.160
the best.

08:25.570 --> 08:26.530
So...

08:30.160 --> 08:30.970
Thank you.

08:48.090 --> 08:50.820
My mom's performance
is absolutely incredible.

08:51.410 --> 08:52.360
I need to work hard too.

08:52.360 --> 08:53.290
I must do my best.

08:54.930 --> 08:57.090
Then I'll restore these recordings

08:57.210 --> 08:58.760
and turn them into vinyl records.

08:58.760 --> 08:59.840
You can keep them as souvenirs

08:59.840 --> 09:01.570
and listen to them whenever you want.

09:01.570 --> 09:02.690
You're so nice,

09:02.690 --> 09:03.690
Shan!

09:05.640 --> 09:06.770
Time to do homework.

09:18.000 --> 09:18.840
Who is it?

09:20.480 --> 09:21.240
Listen.

09:21.240 --> 09:22.810
I've been following
a photography blogger recently.

09:22.810 --> 09:23.940
He's super amazing.

09:25.290 --> 09:27.750
Mengmeng insisted
this photo looks like me.

09:29.760 --> 09:30.620
It does seem...

09:30.880 --> 09:32.080
a little bit like you.

09:32.240 --> 09:33.600
And I feel this person

09:33.600 --> 09:35.120
must be very close to us.

09:36.050 --> 09:37.240
Someone around us.

09:37.450 --> 09:38.000
Look.

09:38.000 --> 09:39.570
This is the breakfast shop,

09:39.970 --> 09:40.640
coffee shop,

09:40.640 --> 09:41.410
and the street we usually go to.

09:41.410 --> 09:43.000
They are exactly the same as where we go.

09:43.000 --> 09:44.930
The photos are quite artistic too.

09:49.240 --> 09:50.970
I also discovered a big secret.

09:51.760 --> 09:52.410
Look.

09:52.600 --> 09:54.210
He pinned the photo of this girl's back

09:54.210 --> 09:54.880
to the top.

09:56.480 --> 09:57.610
What does that mean?

09:58.000 --> 09:59.600
What... does that mean?

09:59.600 --> 10:01.360
He has a secret crush on her.

10:02.410 --> 10:04.120
And this person

10:04.120 --> 10:05.600
must be from our school.

10:05.880 --> 10:07.330
Look at the hem of the school uniform.

10:07.330 --> 10:09.790
It's exactly the same
as our school uniform.

10:09.840 --> 10:10.840
Nowadays,

10:11.410 --> 10:13.090
all these uniforms
are pretty much the same.

10:13.090 --> 10:14.690
There's no real difference.

10:14.930 --> 10:16.190
You don't understand.

10:16.410 --> 10:16.970
Stop looking.

10:16.970 --> 10:18.700
Hurry up and do your questions.

10:19.240 --> 10:20.600
My phone has no signal.

10:20.810 --> 10:22.050
Let me use your phone for a look.

10:22.050 --> 10:23.210
My phone's dead.

10:24.690 --> 10:25.690
You have a secret.

10:27.810 --> 10:29.520
-Give it to me. Give it to me!
-Go back and do your questions!

10:29.520 --> 10:30.290
Give it to me.

10:38.880 --> 10:42.000
Three, two, one!

10:49.880 --> 10:51.640
Your ears are so red.

10:52.120 --> 10:54.650
You're definitely hiding something
from me.

10:56.520 --> 10:57.780
Do your own questions.

11:00.640 --> 11:01.840
Weirdo.

11:07.600 --> 11:09.720
Didn't we agree
we couldn't mortgage the house?

11:09.720 --> 11:11.120
Now we're about to lose the house!

11:11.120 --> 11:13.780
Do you still want
to have a good Chinese New Year?

11:25.470 --> 11:34.440
[Reborn! We Got This]

11:25.720 --> 11:27.240
How about we go to school together
to set off fireworks

11:27.240 --> 11:28.970
on the third day of the New Year?

11:29.330 --> 11:30.840
Is the second day okay?

11:30.970 --> 11:33.720
My mom insists on taking me
to Sanya for a few days.

11:34.360 --> 11:35.240
Mom, stop rushing me.

11:35.240 --> 11:36.300
I'll be there soon.

11:37.050 --> 11:37.840
Wait for me.

11:42.470 --> 11:46.510
[Reborn! We Got This]

11:42.810 --> 11:43.450
Okay.

11:44.410 --> 11:45.050
Okay.

11:45.090 --> 11:46.950
Then let's do it on the second day.

11:47.400 --> 11:49.800
[Okay. Be well.]

11:48.330 --> 11:49.970
Are your parents back?

11:50.930 --> 11:51.290
Mm.

11:51.290 --> 11:51.970
Same as always.

11:51.970 --> 11:54.100
We plan to eat at Zhonghai Restaurant.

11:54.360 --> 11:55.290
My family too.

11:55.520 --> 11:56.330
See you later.

11:56.600 --> 11:57.240
Lan!

11:57.640 --> 11:58.480
Hurry up!

11:58.880 --> 11:59.810
Coming! Coming!

12:09.330 --> 12:11.480
Mr. Guo is holding our goods.

12:11.720 --> 12:13.930
If he doesn't pay,
we'll be in breach of contract.

12:13.930 --> 12:16.000
Then we won't even be able
to pay salaries.

12:16.000 --> 12:17.480
Don't offend him again like last time.

12:17.480 --> 12:18.210
Do you hear me?

12:18.210 --> 12:18.760
Stop nagging.

12:18.760 --> 12:19.210
Got it.

12:19.410 --> 12:20.670
Let me propose a toast.

12:21.640 --> 12:23.170
I wish everyone...

12:24.090 --> 12:25.330
great wealth.

12:26.240 --> 12:27.000
Mr. Guo.

12:28.000 --> 12:28.600
Mr. Guo.

12:28.600 --> 12:29.330
Mr. Guo.

12:29.330 --> 12:30.480
Who's this?

12:30.480 --> 12:32.600
Let me see! Isn't this Mrs. Tong?

12:32.630 --> 12:33.240
What a coincidence.

12:33.240 --> 12:33.760
Mr. Guo.

12:33.760 --> 12:34.640
I want to eat that.

12:34.640 --> 12:35.520
I want to eat that.

12:35.520 --> 12:36.520
I want to eat that!

12:38.240 --> 12:39.240
I want to eat that!

12:40.880 --> 12:41.720
See you later.

12:46.090 --> 12:47.360
I want to eat this.

12:47.360 --> 12:48.760
I want to eat this.

12:48.970 --> 12:51.120
Please take care of us
in next year's business.

12:51.120 --> 12:52.720
-Yes. Yes.
-Take care of you?

12:52.840 --> 12:54.810
Then I can't let you leave.

12:54.810 --> 12:55.570
Come on.

12:55.840 --> 12:56.520
Tong.

12:57.090 --> 12:57.810
Since we've run into each other,

12:57.810 --> 12:59.090
and we haven't seen each other in a while,

12:59.090 --> 12:59.570
here.

13:00.330 --> 13:01.930
Have a drink before you leave.

13:01.930 --> 13:02.640
Okay?

13:02.720 --> 13:04.120
Tong's been having stomach issues lately.

13:04.120 --> 13:04.720
I'll drink with you,

13:04.720 --> 13:05.330
Mr. Guo.

13:05.330 --> 13:05.720
Come on.

13:05.720 --> 13:06.480
Long time no see.

13:06.480 --> 13:06.970
Mrs. Tong.

13:06.970 --> 13:07.410
Get me a glass.

13:07.410 --> 13:07.840
You...

13:07.840 --> 13:08.640
P-Put it down.

13:08.880 --> 13:09.840
Listen to me.

13:10.640 --> 13:11.520
While I'm around,

13:11.520 --> 13:12.880
I won't have women drink.

13:12.880 --> 13:13.330
Yes.

13:13.480 --> 13:14.410
That's never

13:14.410 --> 13:15.210
my style.

13:15.470 --> 13:15.970
Tong.

13:15.970 --> 13:16.360
Here.

13:16.410 --> 13:17.880
It's fine for you, Tong.

13:18.520 --> 13:19.640
I won't bully you.

13:19.880 --> 13:20.610
Half a glass.

13:20.640 --> 13:21.000
Okay.

13:21.570 --> 13:23.170
-Half a glass.
-I'll down it.

13:27.570 --> 13:28.170
Chen.

13:28.170 --> 13:28.760
Good.

13:28.760 --> 13:29.760
I was right, right?

13:29.760 --> 13:30.410
But

13:30.410 --> 13:31.120
since you are asking for a favor,

13:31.120 --> 13:32.690
how can you only drink half a glass?

13:32.690 --> 13:33.760
You are bullying Mr. Tong.

13:33.760 --> 13:35.220
That's not sincere at all.

13:35.290 --> 13:35.760
Fine.

13:35.880 --> 13:36.570
Then... Then Chen...

13:36.570 --> 13:37.090
You have a drink with him.

13:37.090 --> 13:37.480
I'll also have a drink with him.

13:37.480 --> 13:38.210
Okay?

13:38.210 --> 13:39.240
Let's toast Mr. Tong together.

13:39.240 --> 13:39.570
Come on.

13:39.570 --> 13:40.520
Come on. Come on.

13:40.880 --> 13:42.050
Come on.

13:42.290 --> 13:43.640
Please take care of us, Mr. Guo.

13:43.640 --> 13:44.600
Okay. Come on.

13:45.000 --> 13:45.720
Bottoms up.

13:45.720 --> 13:46.330
No problem. Right?

13:46.330 --> 13:47.000
Bottoms up.

13:50.970 --> 13:51.970
Dad, Mom,

13:52.240 --> 13:53.520
Aunt, Uncle,

13:53.520 --> 13:54.640
Lan, Xiao,

13:55.050 --> 13:56.520
today, I'm going to perform

13:56.520 --> 13:58.320
a set of boxing moves for you all.

13:58.320 --> 13:58.900
Okay.

14:18.930 --> 14:19.570
Good!

14:19.570 --> 14:21.170
Good! Good! Good!

14:23.210 --> 14:24.450
Xuan, you did great.

14:24.690 --> 14:25.290
Come here.

14:28.760 --> 14:30.410
I'm giving you a red envelope.

14:30.410 --> 14:31.600
Keep up the good work.

14:31.600 --> 14:32.530
Thank you, Aunt.

14:33.480 --> 14:34.090
Here.

14:34.090 --> 14:34.690
Off you go.

14:37.120 --> 14:38.240
Dad, Auntie,

14:38.810 --> 14:39.610
Aunt,

14:39.840 --> 14:40.480
Uncle,

14:40.810 --> 14:41.410
Xiao,

14:41.410 --> 14:43.170
I'm also going to show you something.

14:43.170 --> 14:43.840
Okay.

15:46.120 --> 15:46.760
Good.

15:49.210 --> 15:50.090
Lan,

15:50.450 --> 15:52.450
did you just miss two notes?

15:54.090 --> 15:56.090
How many hours do you practice a day?

16:00.970 --> 16:02.700
Can she get admitted like this?

16:04.000 --> 16:04.760
Sister,

16:05.410 --> 16:06.810
the exam is already over.

16:07.640 --> 16:08.120
Well,

16:08.330 --> 16:10.240
Lan has been nervous around you
since she was little.

16:10.240 --> 16:10.900
Well, look.

16:14.480 --> 16:15.210
Xiao,

16:15.840 --> 16:17.090
here's a red envelope from me.

16:17.090 --> 16:17.360
Here.

16:17.360 --> 16:18.240
Here. Here.

16:18.240 --> 16:18.640
Here.

16:18.840 --> 16:19.360
Thank your uncle.

16:19.360 --> 16:19.880
Thank you, Uncle.

16:19.880 --> 16:21.480
It's nothing. It's nothing.

16:21.720 --> 16:22.480
Sister...

16:22.930 --> 16:23.530
Let's eat.

16:23.720 --> 16:24.360
Eat.

16:24.360 --> 16:24.720
Okay,

16:24.720 --> 16:25.410
let's eat.

16:25.480 --> 16:26.120
Lan, come.

16:26.120 --> 16:26.720
Let's eat.

16:29.410 --> 16:30.880
Here, Tong.

16:31.120 --> 16:32.870
Let's drink red wine this time.

16:33.290 --> 16:34.760
I've learned a new skill—

16:34.880 --> 16:35.740
mixing drinks.

16:36.930 --> 16:38.600
Red wine and baijiu

16:38.600 --> 16:39.600
together.

16:41.290 --> 16:42.050
Mix them and drink.

16:42.050 --> 16:42.510
Come on.

16:42.520 --> 16:42.980
Come on.

16:44.360 --> 16:44.970
Dad.

16:47.760 --> 16:48.480
What are you doing here?

16:48.480 --> 16:49.280
Don't, don't.

16:49.600 --> 16:50.760
Mr. Guo, right?

16:51.000 --> 16:51.720
I'll

16:51.720 --> 16:54.050
drink this toast to you
on behalf of my dad.

16:54.360 --> 16:54.640
Wait a minute!

16:54.640 --> 16:55.000
Wait a minute! Wait a minute!

16:55.000 --> 16:55.560
Tong.

16:55.690 --> 16:56.810
The one you always talk about...

16:56.810 --> 16:57.120
The one named...

16:57.120 --> 16:57.600
Xiaole.

16:57.600 --> 16:59.170
Xiaole, the top scorer
in the high school entrance exam, right?

16:59.170 --> 16:59.810
Yes, yes.

17:00.330 --> 17:02.190
Call him Mr. Guo. Call him Mr. Guo.

17:02.480 --> 17:03.480
Hello, Xiaole.

17:03.760 --> 17:04.369
What?

17:04.520 --> 17:05.650
Xiaole wants to drink?

17:05.650 --> 17:06.760
He'll have to learn sooner or later.

17:06.760 --> 17:08.040
Like father, like son.

17:08.280 --> 17:08.800
How about this?

17:08.800 --> 17:09.800
If you drink it...

17:09.800 --> 17:10.690
If you drink with me,

17:10.690 --> 17:12.130
I will give you a big red envelope.

17:12.130 --> 17:13.130
Kids can't drink alcohol.

17:13.130 --> 17:13.930
He can handle it.

17:13.930 --> 17:14.930
He'll have to learn sooner or later.

17:14.930 --> 17:15.410
Come on!

17:15.650 --> 17:16.000
Let...

17:16.000 --> 17:17.060
Let your son drink!

17:19.849 --> 17:21.760
Such a mess!

17:21.760 --> 17:24.000
So ominous during Chinese New Year!

17:24.000 --> 17:24.970
This... This...

17:24.970 --> 17:26.079
This is outrageous.

17:26.079 --> 17:26.800
Look at your child.

17:26.800 --> 17:27.970
You've spoiled him too much.

17:27.970 --> 17:28.610
It's Chinese New Year.

17:28.610 --> 17:29.450
This...

17:29.720 --> 17:30.520
Dad, get up.

17:30.520 --> 17:31.580
What are you doing?

17:32.040 --> 17:32.650
Dad!

17:33.000 --> 17:33.850
Can't you see this person

17:33.850 --> 17:36.650
is deliberately making things
difficult for you?

17:43.520 --> 17:44.080
Stop.

17:50.210 --> 17:51.670
What were you yelling for?

17:53.280 --> 17:55.520
Today we're here for the reunion dinner.

17:55.520 --> 17:57.980
How long has it been
since you last came home?

17:58.610 --> 17:59.520
Just to make money,

17:59.520 --> 18:00.380
was it worth it?

18:00.690 --> 18:02.690
I've been working hard
to earn money to support you,

18:02.690 --> 18:04.290
and you're feeling wronged?

18:06.450 --> 18:08.170
Do you look down on your old man?

18:08.170 --> 18:08.800
Yes!

18:09.520 --> 18:10.690
I do look down on you!

18:33.800 --> 18:35.330
I want to go out for some air.

18:47.100 --> 18:47.930
What's wrong?

18:48.210 --> 18:49.280
How did you fall?

18:49.450 --> 18:50.210
What happened?

18:50.210 --> 18:50.690
Come, come.

18:50.690 --> 18:51.240
Be careful.

18:51.240 --> 18:52.450
It hurts so much!

18:52.890 --> 18:54.080
Let me help you up first.

18:54.080 --> 18:55.540
Did you sprain your ankle?

18:55.970 --> 18:57.130
Yes!

18:57.320 --> 18:58.210
Don't move!

18:58.520 --> 18:59.240
It hurts so much.

18:59.240 --> 19:00.280
How did you fall?

19:00.280 --> 19:01.030
Come, come.

19:01.320 --> 19:02.180
Stand up first.

19:03.760 --> 19:04.770
Are you okay?

19:05.080 --> 19:06.370
What... What could be wrong with me?

19:06.370 --> 19:07.800
Don't be too upset.

19:08.000 --> 19:08.760
No matter what happens,

19:08.760 --> 19:10.090
I'll stand by your side.

19:11.350 --> 19:12.040
You're already like this,

19:12.040 --> 19:13.240
and you still want to stand by my side?

19:13.240 --> 19:15.040
I should be the one standing by your side.

19:15.040 --> 19:15.410
Come.

19:16.130 --> 19:17.450
Let me help you up first.

19:17.450 --> 19:18.580
Sit down over there.

19:20.130 --> 19:20.450
Come.

19:20.450 --> 19:21.110
Be careful.

19:23.040 --> 19:23.890
Be careful.

19:28.450 --> 19:29.000
Xiaole,

19:29.240 --> 19:31.000
I saw Mr. Tong scolding you.

19:31.210 --> 19:32.000
It's okay.

19:32.080 --> 19:33.290
Cry if you want to.

19:34.800 --> 19:36.410
Who is the one crying now?

19:37.850 --> 19:38.210
Come.

19:38.320 --> 19:39.320
Let me take a look.

19:40.080 --> 19:42.080
Let me take a look. Let me take a look.

19:43.760 --> 19:45.490
I can't move it. I can't move it.

19:46.280 --> 19:47.610
This hurts way too much.

19:50.610 --> 19:51.540
Wait for me here.

19:51.610 --> 19:54.010
I'll go over there
to buy you some medicine!

19:54.800 --> 19:55.460
Wait for me!

20:06.800 --> 20:08.930
Why does it hurt and feel cold?

20:33.480 --> 20:34.370
Little troublemaker,

20:34.370 --> 20:35.890
stop messing with my cello.

20:35.890 --> 20:37.280
I need to put it away.

20:37.610 --> 20:38.240
Sister,

20:38.240 --> 20:39.280
you promised

20:39.280 --> 20:41.040
you'd let me play if you got good grades!

20:41.040 --> 20:42.760
Why are you going back on your word?

20:42.760 --> 20:43.970
That was Dad who promised!

20:43.970 --> 20:44.610
I didn't promise anything!

20:44.610 --> 20:45.280
Give it to me now!

20:45.280 --> 20:46.810
I just want to play for a bit!

20:46.930 --> 20:48.040
Sister, you're a liar!

20:48.040 --> 20:49.520
You don't keep your word!

20:49.760 --> 20:50.320
Since the exam is over,

20:50.320 --> 20:51.780
just let him play for a bit.

20:54.850 --> 20:55.980
Aunt, why are you...

20:56.240 --> 20:57.800
why are you so partial?

20:58.370 --> 20:59.040
Dad!

20:59.040 --> 21:00.610
I just want to play for a bit!

21:00.970 --> 21:01.560
Give it to me!

21:01.560 --> 21:02.210
Get lost!

21:02.450 --> 21:03.040
Dad!

21:03.210 --> 21:03.690
Dad!

21:03.760 --> 21:04.320
Dad!

21:04.320 --> 21:04.800
Dad!

21:04.930 --> 21:05.450
Dad!

21:05.450 --> 21:05.970
Dad!

21:06.130 --> 21:06.690
Dad!

21:06.690 --> 21:07.210
Dad!

21:08.320 --> 21:10.120
What are you arguing about here?

21:18.690 --> 21:19.890
You've gone too far.

21:22.000 --> 21:22.610
Xuan!

21:23.040 --> 21:23.760
Xuan!

21:24.240 --> 21:25.840
Go apologize to your sister!

21:27.850 --> 21:28.690
Lan.

21:32.850 --> 21:33.410
Yi Lan!

21:36.450 --> 21:37.700
Where did you get the coat?

21:37.700 --> 21:38.930
I went to get it.

21:39.240 --> 21:39.970
Here. Here. Here.

21:39.970 --> 21:41.800
Let me apply the medicine for you first.

21:41.800 --> 21:42.530
Bear with it.

21:46.130 --> 21:46.970
Bear with it.

21:47.480 --> 21:49.140
Does it really hurt this much?

21:50.410 --> 21:52.900
My brother broke my cello!

21:54.170 --> 21:55.560
The cello is broken?

21:56.240 --> 21:57.240
Can it be fixed?

21:57.240 --> 21:58.090
I don't know.

21:58.480 --> 21:59.810
It's all my dad's fault.

22:00.370 --> 22:02.370
He got drunk and didn't control him.

22:05.690 --> 22:06.130
Here.

22:08.930 --> 22:10.390
You're already like this,

22:10.480 --> 22:11.800
and you still brought plum syrup?

22:11.800 --> 22:13.760
You drink it every year
and you never get tired of it.

22:13.760 --> 22:15.210
There are steamed buns too.

22:15.210 --> 22:16.610
I specially brought them for you.

22:16.610 --> 22:18.010
I know you haven't eaten.

22:18.650 --> 22:19.170
Eat.

22:21.800 --> 22:22.860
They're still hot.

22:23.080 --> 22:25.040
These are
my brother's favorite steamed buns.

22:25.040 --> 22:26.040
I packed them all.

22:26.040 --> 22:27.300
I won't let him eat any.

22:29.240 --> 22:29.970
Yi Lan.

22:31.370 --> 22:33.200
Don't be too good to me.

22:33.480 --> 22:34.940
Is being good to you wrong?

22:35.930 --> 22:36.990
What are you doing?

22:37.320 --> 22:38.800
Shutting you up.

22:44.890 --> 22:46.970
Sister, I'm sorry.

22:47.450 --> 22:50.280
I'll never touch your cello again.

22:51.520 --> 22:52.560
Brother.

22:53.480 --> 22:54.480
It's okay.

22:55.410 --> 22:56.010
Let's hug.

23:00.850 --> 23:02.080
Brother.

23:02.610 --> 23:04.450
Let's never argue again, okay?

23:04.450 --> 23:05.170
Okay!

23:05.320 --> 23:06.470
Okay?

23:06.500 --> 23:07.300
Okay!

23:07.800 --> 23:09.800
Is it okay if I eat your steamed buns?

23:10.480 --> 23:12.410
It's good that you're okay with it.

23:14.520 --> 23:17.080
You're the best brother in the world.

23:32.170 --> 23:33.320
Are you okay?

23:48.210 --> 23:49.410
Let me tell you.

23:49.520 --> 23:51.080
This is nothing.

23:51.450 --> 23:52.710
Is this even a problem?

23:52.760 --> 23:53.740
Let's go again.

23:54.210 --> 23:55.320
Take it easy.

23:55.480 --> 23:56.650
Still half a glass, okay?

23:56.650 --> 23:56.970
Okay.

23:56.970 --> 23:57.970
I won't bully you.

23:58.040 --> 23:58.410
No problem.

23:58.410 --> 24:00.000
We're good.

24:13.280 --> 24:14.760
Are you okay, Tong?

24:14.760 --> 24:15.800
I'm fine.

24:29.450 --> 24:30.040
Xiaole.

24:30.850 --> 24:32.170
You haven't eaten, have you?

24:32.170 --> 24:33.520
I made dumplings for you.

24:33.520 --> 24:34.000
Mom,

24:34.210 --> 24:35.450
I just ate outside.

24:36.410 --> 24:37.040
Xiaole.

24:39.560 --> 24:40.720
I shouldn't have...

24:41.760 --> 24:42.960
slapped you just now.

24:47.520 --> 24:49.040
Mr. Bu told me everything

24:49.610 --> 24:50.760
about you at school.

24:51.880 --> 24:53.040
You like photography.

24:53.040 --> 24:54.840
You could have told me directly.

24:55.000 --> 24:56.930
I didn't insist you study Finance.

24:57.080 --> 24:58.210
I just wanted you...

24:58.240 --> 24:59.280
to have a goal,

24:59.280 --> 25:00.680
something to strive for.

25:04.130 --> 25:04.970
Look, Xiaole.

25:07.210 --> 25:08.480
This is a camera your dad asked someone

25:08.480 --> 25:10.080
to bring from abroad for you.

25:10.080 --> 25:11.950
We wanted to surprise you.

25:16.580 --> 25:18.840
Tong, do you have something to say to him?

25:19.370 --> 25:19.800
Right?

25:25.720 --> 25:26.180
It's...

25:27.140 --> 25:28.870
not that I don't care about you.

25:29.040 --> 25:31.300
Every time I asked if you needed company,

25:32.320 --> 25:32.980
you said...

25:33.800 --> 25:34.280
no.

25:35.320 --> 25:36.130
And...

25:36.210 --> 25:38.040
we argued whenever we met.

25:39.480 --> 25:40.280
I always felt

25:40.280 --> 25:41.480
you found me annoying

25:41.760 --> 25:43.220
and you liked being alone.

25:46.520 --> 25:47.210
Look at our son.

25:47.210 --> 25:48.280
We don't usually supervise him,

25:48.280 --> 25:49.520
but his grades are good.

25:49.520 --> 25:49.970
Right?

25:50.280 --> 25:52.210
Your dad was worried
you found him annoying.

25:52.210 --> 25:53.560
You always ignored him at home.

25:53.560 --> 25:53.930
Right?

25:53.930 --> 25:54.990
He overthought it.

25:55.130 --> 25:55.850
Don't be angry.

25:55.850 --> 25:56.480
Xiaole.

25:57.320 --> 25:58.580
You like photography.

25:59.370 --> 26:00.500
After you graduate,

26:00.720 --> 26:02.580
we'll open a photography studio.

26:03.450 --> 26:04.760
With the money your mom and I earn,

26:04.760 --> 26:06.040
we can open a big one for you.

26:06.040 --> 26:07.240
Hurry and make him write it down,

26:07.240 --> 26:08.900
so he won't go back on his word.

26:10.040 --> 26:10.610
Mom.

26:11.080 --> 26:12.010
Hold this for me.

26:15.240 --> 26:15.850
Dad.

26:17.560 --> 26:18.690
Drink this.

26:19.000 --> 26:20.590
Drink less alcohol in the future.

26:20.590 --> 26:22.050
It's bad for your stomach.

26:22.720 --> 26:23.780
Thank you, Xiaole.

26:25.610 --> 26:27.800
From now on,
I'll take good care of the family

26:27.800 --> 26:29.200
and take good care of you.

26:32.320 --> 26:33.280
Give me a hug.

26:33.720 --> 26:34.940
Come. Let me lift you up.

26:34.940 --> 26:35.760
Dad! Dad!

26:35.760 --> 26:36.240
Come on.

26:36.240 --> 26:37.370
I'm... I'm too old for this!

26:37.370 --> 26:38.370
Put me down!

26:38.370 --> 26:39.240
Put me down!

26:40.320 --> 26:41.870
Mom, look at him!

26:42.040 --> 26:43.650
Put me down!

26:43.680 --> 26:44.710
No.

26:45.040 --> 26:46.080
Come on.

27:47.080 --> 27:48.240
Who has a lighter?

27:50.760 --> 27:52.020
Where did you get that?

27:58.650 --> 27:59.480
Pass it along.

28:13.650 --> 28:14.480
Ning.

28:17.720 --> 28:20.450
The school at night
is actually quite beautiful.

28:36.040 --> 28:37.320
-Chen Fan!
-Chen Fan!

28:37.320 --> 28:38.850
You really are annoying!

28:38.850 --> 28:40.380
Who are you trying to scare?

28:40.520 --> 28:42.080
You're going to attract Director Hu here.

28:42.080 --> 28:43.320
Ning,

28:43.690 --> 28:46.150
I've never seen you
smile so happily before.

28:48.800 --> 28:50.040
Because being with you guys

28:50.040 --> 28:51.300
makes me really happy.

28:51.560 --> 28:53.350
If you're happy,
you should laugh out loud.

28:53.350 --> 28:55.480
You look really pretty when you smile.

29:01.690 --> 29:02.520
At this hour,

29:02.520 --> 29:04.250
Director Hu is still on patrol?

29:05.850 --> 29:06.690
Hello!

29:08.480 --> 29:11.140
-Zhao Zhenghao?
-Why are you guys here so early?

29:12.760 --> 29:13.850
Qiao Mengmeng.

29:14.370 --> 29:15.320
It wasn't me.

29:16.320 --> 29:17.440
I invited him.

29:17.720 --> 29:18.940
Isn't Zhenghao

29:18.960 --> 29:20.150
part of our group?

29:20.240 --> 29:21.240
Of course.

29:23.760 --> 29:25.170
Look! Fireworks!

29:27.130 --> 29:28.190
Quick, make a wish!

29:34.760 --> 29:36.850
I hope I can
successfully pass the art exam

29:36.850 --> 29:38.290
and get admitted to Hailan University.

29:38.290 --> 29:41.080
♪ Dusk gently fell on the coastline ♪

29:40.040 --> 29:41.080
Why did you eavesdrop?

29:41.080 --> 29:42.370
It won't come true if you eavesdrop!

29:41.930 --> 29:44.910
♪ The quietly passing breeze
gave the clouds a kiss ♪

29:43.000 --> 29:44.480
You are so annoying!

29:44.560 --> 29:45.800
I didn't mean to.

29:45.320 --> 29:46.990
♪ The Earth keeps spinning round ♪

29:45.970 --> 29:46.800
That's not fair!

29:46.800 --> 29:47.720
You make a wish too!

29:47.010 --> 29:48.730
♪ Painted with shades of romance ♪

29:49.230 --> 29:51.920
♪ That was the moment I met you ♪

29:49.760 --> 29:50.800
Then...

29:51.210 --> 29:52.690
I hope Yi Lan
can successfully pass the exam.

29:52.260 --> 29:55.020
♪ Even mountains and seas
can't separate us ♪

29:54.040 --> 29:56.130
Well, I still heard it!

29:55.800 --> 29:58.850
♪ I wish I could turn into a bird
to explore the world for you ♪

29:56.890 --> 29:59.130
May next year be kinder to all of us!

29:59.250 --> 30:00.800
♪ The vast, boundless Milky Way ♪

30:00.480 --> 30:01.800
Make a lot of money!

30:00.820 --> 30:02.550
♪ Sings its tender serenade ♪

30:02.640 --> 30:05.260
♪ I can't live a second without you ♪

30:02.690 --> 30:04.890
May everyone's wishes come true!

30:06.190 --> 30:09.350
♪ Looking forward
to the next beautiful dream ♪

30:07.720 --> 30:08.560
Goodbye,

30:08.560 --> 30:09.410
the past!

30:09.650 --> 30:10.820
♪ I just want to be with you ♪

30:11.140 --> 30:14.060
♪ To see the most romantic starry sky
together ♪

30:11.280 --> 30:12.280
Hello,

30:12.280 --> 30:13.850
the future!

30:14.490 --> 30:18.510
♪ The evening breeze tells
heartfelt emotions ♪

30:19.420 --> 30:21.060
♪ All the stars surround you ♪

30:21.080 --> 30:22.750
♪ The moon smiles at you ♪

30:22.780 --> 30:25.920
♪ I give you all the good things
in the world ♪

30:26.150 --> 30:27.950
♪ And the light in your eyes ♪

30:27.970 --> 30:29.960
♪ Shines like diamonds ♪

30:30.310 --> 30:33.110
♪ Drawing an exclamation mark
in my world ♪

30:33.230 --> 30:34.750
♪ The evening breeze embraces you ♪

30:34.770 --> 30:36.520
♪ And I run towards you ♪

30:36.580 --> 30:39.870
♪ I hear our passionate heartbeats ♪

30:40.130 --> 30:41.780
♪ We borrow a dream ♪

30:41.810 --> 30:43.700
♪ To build a castle ♪

30:44.070 --> 30:46.540
♪ Every star is a romantic symbol ♪

30:46.650 --> 30:49.010
♪ Let me find you ♪

30:51.520 --> 30:52.520
Being young is great.

30:52.520 --> 30:54.650
You can fall asleep whenever you want.

30:55.930 --> 30:56.850
You're here.

30:57.760 --> 30:58.560
What's wrong?

30:59.560 --> 31:01.690
I got the qualification certificate.

31:01.760 --> 31:02.970
Isn't that a good thing?

31:02.970 --> 31:03.930
Why look so down?

31:04.280 --> 31:05.720
My ranking is very low.

31:06.760 --> 31:07.410
How low?

31:08.280 --> 31:09.210
The 33rd place.

31:10.370 --> 31:11.650
How many do they admit?

31:12.800 --> 31:13.410
15.

31:16.480 --> 31:18.340
Then there's no chance. Let's go.

31:19.560 --> 31:20.850
If I achieve good academic results,

31:20.850 --> 31:22.380
I still have a chance, okay?

31:23.040 --> 31:24.320
You mean

31:24.350 --> 31:26.650
you want to improve your grades?

31:26.850 --> 31:27.890
Of course!

31:28.080 --> 31:29.610
Who are you looking down on?

31:31.480 --> 31:32.320
That's good.

31:35.280 --> 31:36.010
Hello, Ning.

31:36.690 --> 31:37.890
I saw your ranking.

31:37.970 --> 31:39.040
I think though being the 33rd place,

31:39.040 --> 31:40.640
you still have a good chance.

31:41.210 --> 31:41.970
Yes.

31:42.690 --> 31:43.690
How did you do?

31:44.180 --> 31:44.710
I passed.

31:45.040 --> 31:47.280
I also passed the exams
at the other universities.

31:47.280 --> 31:48.280
That's amazing.

31:48.930 --> 31:51.370
Then... do you have a preferred choice?

31:51.930 --> 31:53.130
I don't know yet.

31:53.370 --> 31:55.410
It depends on my academic results.

31:55.850 --> 31:57.930
Then I should start focusing
on improving academic results too,

31:57.930 --> 31:59.650
so we can be schoolmates.

32:00.130 --> 32:00.520
Okay.

32:00.720 --> 32:01.080
Mm.

32:07.520 --> 32:08.080
Come on.

32:08.970 --> 32:10.280
You're kidding, right?

32:10.280 --> 32:11.320
Tutor me!

32:11.320 --> 32:12.210
No!

32:13.080 --> 32:14.370
What do you want now?

32:18.820 --> 32:21.390
♪ She left in spring ♪

32:22.340 --> 32:25.220
♪ Gone with her was cherry blossoms ♪

32:25.940 --> 32:28.390
♪ On the once youthful face ♪

32:29.580 --> 32:32.050
♪ There were tears amidst confusion ♪

32:30.020 --> 32:32.010
[Second Mock Exam Results]

32:33.140 --> 32:36.000
♪ She left in spring ♪

32:36.610 --> 32:39.590
♪ All was like a dream ♪

32:40.170 --> 32:43.020
♪ Youth never lasts ♪

32:43.040 --> 32:44.040
There's still enough time.

32:44.040 --> 32:46.520
♪ Just let her go ♪

32:47.170 --> 32:48.310
[Grade 12's Mock Exam Results]

32:47.660 --> 32:49.750
♪ The paper plane that was once set free ♪

32:50.070 --> 32:53.320
♪ Will find its way back
to the old desk and chair at school ♪

32:53.650 --> 32:56.710
♪ All stories have yet to end ♪

32:57.110 --> 32:58.480
♪ Let me write for you ♪

32:58.540 --> 33:02.270
♪ An old CD will witness
our ever-ending dreams ♪

33:02.020 --> 33:02.840
[Grade 12's Mock Exam Results]

33:02.480 --> 33:05.530
♪ Youth is nothing but a farce ♪

33:05.620 --> 33:08.810
♪ In which everyone has fun till the end ♪

33:07.940 --> 33:08.200
[Unit Test Papers]

33:08.220 --> 33:09.310
[Grade 12's Mock Exam Results]

33:08.840 --> 33:12.300
♪ It's a pity time always sneaks away ♪

33:12.570 --> 33:14.760
♪ Leaving behind so many headaches ♪

33:14.830 --> 33:16.350
♪ We never had the time to look back on ♪

33:16.620 --> 33:19.410
♪ Youth is nothing but a farce ♪

33:19.520 --> 33:22.460
♪ We live it wholeheartedly ♪

33:22.800 --> 33:26.370
♪ Joy and sorrow are woven together ♪

33:26.770 --> 33:30.140
♪ Every experience will bring me closer ♪

33:30.440 --> 33:30.970
♪ To myself ♪

33:30.990 --> 33:32.470
♪ The teacher frowned,
saying I don't understand ♪

33:32.500 --> 33:34.250
♪ But the backpack on my shoulder
makes me weightless ♪

33:34.630 --> 33:36.030
♪ I vaguely recall the past dreams ♪

33:36.070 --> 33:37.880
♪ They make me brave, no matter
how far I go or how hard I fall ♪

33:37.650 --> 33:39.040
[The Final Class]

33:37.900 --> 33:39.710
♪ Jay Chou's songs play on my phone ♪

33:39.240 --> 33:39.890
You all are

33:39.860 --> 33:41.570
♪ Earphone wires
thread through my uniform's sleeve ♪

33:40.240 --> 33:41.690
